/S/Span<</ActualText(\040\040\\begin\040{split}\040log\(M_{rb}\)\040&=\040\\sum\040_{i=1}^{k}\040w_{i\040}log\(R_{p_{i}}\)\040-\040\\sum\040_{i=1}^{k}\040w_{i\040}log\(B_{p_{i}}\)\040\\\\\040&=\040\\sum\040_{i=1}^{k}\040w_{i\040}\040\(log\(m\(\\Vec\040{n_{p_{i}}},\040\\Vec\040{l_{p_{i}}}\)\)\040+\040log\(e^{R_{p_{i}}}\(\\lambda\040\)\)\040+\040log\(\\rho\040^{R_{p_{i}}}\(\\lambda\040\)\)\040\)\040\\\\\040&-\040\\sum\040_{i=1}^{k}\040w_{i\040}\040\(log\(m\(\\Vec\040{n_{p_{i}}},\040\\Vec\040{l_{p_{i}}}\)\)\040+\040log\(e^{B_{p_{i}}}\(\\lambda\040\)\)\040+\040log\(\\rho\040^{B_{p_{i}}}\(\\lambda\040\)\)\040\)\040\\\\\040&=\040\\sum\040_{i=1}^{k}\040w_{i\040}log\(e^{R_{p_{i}}}\(\\lambda\040\)\)\040-\040\\sum\040_{i=1}^{k}\040w_{i\040}log\(e^{B_{p_{i}}}\(\\lambda\040\)\)\040\\\\\040&+\\sum\040_{i=1}^{k}\040w_{i\040}log\(\\rho\040^{R_{p_{i}}}\(\\lambda\040\)\)\040-\040\\sum\040_{i=1}^{k}\040w_{i\040}log\(\\rho\040^{B_{p_{i}}}\(\\lambda\040\)\)\040\\end\040{split}\040\\label\040{equ:iim_detail_}\040)>>BDC
